```

Table with columns: Name, Type, Subtype, Description, Lore, Keywords. Sortable by Name/Type/Subtype. Inline editing: `editingCell: {entityId: number; field: keyof EditableFields} | null`. On click of a cell, render an `<Input>` or `<Textarea>` in place. On blur or Enter, call `updateEntity`. Subtype cell uses a `<Select>`. 

State shape for table:
```ts
const [sortCol, setSortCol] = useState<"name"|"type"|"subtype"|null>(null);
const [sortDir, setSortDir] = useState<"asc"|"desc">("asc");
